{"4637280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Weapon Skills", "steam_appid": 4637280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Weapon Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a fast-paced action experience where precision, timing, and smart decisions matter more than brute force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game puts you in control of a character equipped with melee weapons, challenging you to survive encounters against enemies that punish every mistake. Movement, positioning, and attack timing are key.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Close Combat Focus</strong> <br>Fight using a melee weapon and master the timing of each attack. Combat is simple to learn, but hard to truly master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Risk Encounters</strong> <br>Enemies are dangerous on contact - getting too close without a plan means instant punishment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Progression</strong> <br>There are no shortcuts. Improvement comes from player skill, not grinding.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Makes It Different</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t a button-mashing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fight forces you to think:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When to attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When to keep distance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When to take a risk</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game rewards players who stay calm under pressure and learn from their mistakes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is actively being developed with a focus on gameplay feel and responsiveness. Feedback will directly shape future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Závěrečný projekt DIGI 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gymnázium Havlíčkův Brod</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daniel Vaněk, Filip Přemysl Denemark</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Weapon Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a fast-paced action experience where precision, timing, and smart decisions matter more than brute force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game puts you in control of a character equipped with melee weapons, challenging you to survive encounters against enemies that punish every mistake. Movement, positioning, and attack timing are key.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Close Combat Focus</strong> <br>Fight using a melee weapon and master the timing of each attack. Combat is simple to learn, but hard to truly master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Risk Encounters</strong> <br>Enemies are dangerous on contact - getting too close without a plan means instant punishment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Progression</strong> <br>There are no shortcuts. Improvement comes from player skill, not grinding.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Makes It Different</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t a button-mashing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fight forces you to think:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When to attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When to keep distance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When to take a risk</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game rewards players who stay calm under pressure and learn from their mistakes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is actively being developed with a focus on gameplay feel and responsiveness. Feedback will directly shape future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Závěrečný projekt DIGI 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gymnázium Havlíčkův Brod</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daniel Vaněk, Filip Přemysl Denemark</p>", "short_description": "Master precision-based combat where every move matters. Fight using melee weapons and throwable attacks while avoiding deadly enemies that punish every mistake. Improve your timing, positioning, and decision-making to survive increasingly challenging encounters.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637280/b4d5d3b74ffeee59631af63dffdb24a2896937b8/header.jpg?t=1779559242", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637280/e8bd1e94113f0286ccddc5cbdf4b87512d091038/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779559242", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637280/e8bd1e94113f0286ccddc5cbdf4b87512d091038/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779559242", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Daniel Vaněk", "Filip Přemysl Denemark"], "publishers": ["Daniel Vaněk"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 99, "final": 99, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$0